{{// 🥰 Chibi Bonds Lite: an optional relationship tracker in about 124 tokens where the full edition spends 297. Every meaningful pair gets a BOND score from -10 to +20 plus Sparks and Grudge counters. Seven kinds of warm acts earn Sparks, at most 2 per pair a turn; 7 Sparks become one point of BOND and 5 slights cost one; 3 Grudge halve the gains and a sincere repair clears them. Touch gates (+4 hug, +8 hand-holding, +12 kiss, +15 sex) allow things and never force them; love is declared only from +15, +20 opens marriage proposals answered from your past acts, and at -6 or below a character seeks harm. The numbers live in their own small 💚 ledger at the end of each reply, after the 🎲 ledger when Fate is on, and the preset's regex scripts draw each pair as a card with Bond, Sparks and Grudge bars. Chibi dropped the middle of the full edition's scale (hostile, neutral, warm, trust, devoted) and the <bonds> tags. Ships OFF.}}{{trim}}

{{setvar::ariaBondsLine::- Bonds: listed acts add Sparks (max 2 per pair), slights Grudge; Sparks 7: BOND +1, Sparks 0.}}{{#if !.ariaLedgerLine}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerLine::- Ledger: last 💚 block plus this turn's changes; the closing 💚 block copies it.}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerGate::- Ledger: one <details><summary>💚</summary>pairs</details> block ends the reply; BOND rises only at 7 Sparks.}}{{else}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerLine::- Ledger: last 🎲 and 💚 blocks plus this turn's changes, ages +1; the closing 🎲 then 💚 blocks copy them.}}{{setvar::ariaLedgerGate::- Ledger: one full 🎲 block, then one <details><summary>💚</summary>pairs</details> block, end the reply; BOND rises only at 7 Sparks.}}{{/if}}{{trim}}

Track meaningful pairs in the 💚 block: Name↔Name +6/3/0 (BOND/Sparks/Grudge); strangers 0/0/0.
BOND -10..+20; ≤-6 seeks harm; love declared only at +15+; +20 proposals, answered from {{user}}'s past acts.
Touch gates: +4 hug; +8 hand-holding; +12 kiss; +15 sex (context allowing).
Sparks +1 per act to the other, ≤2/turn: gift, favour, defence, confiding, laugh, being chosen, willing touch; 7: BOND +1, Sparks 0. Grudge +1 per slight; 5: BOND -1, Grudge 0; 3+ halves gains; sincere repair clears it.
